<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>New VedVivah Account Created</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova", sans-serif;
      background-color: #ffe6eb;
      color: #333;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: auto;
      background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #ffc0cb;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .header img {
      max-width: 180px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .content h1 {
      color: #ff5b77;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .content h2 {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .details {
      text-align: left;
      background-color: #fff9fa;
      border: 1px solid #ffe1e8;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .details p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .highlight {
      color: #ff5b77;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #fff3f6;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #777;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #ff5b77;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .content { padding: 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <a href="https://www.vaidikvivah.in">
        <img src="https://vaidikvivah.in/vaidikvivah-img.jpg" alt="VaidikVivah Logo" />
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h1>🪔 New Account Registered</h1>
      <h2>VedVivah User Details</h2>

      <div class="details">
        <p><strong>Name:</strong> <span class="highlight"><%= name %></span></p>
        <p><strong>User ID:</strong> <span class="highlight"><%= userId %></span></p>
        <p><strong>Religion:</strong> <%= religion %></p>
        <p><strong>Caste:</strong> <%= caste %></p>
        <p><strong>Community:</strong> <%= community %></p>
        <p><strong>Date of Birth:</strong> <%= dateOfBirth %></p>
        <p><strong>Time of Birth:</strong> <%= timeOfBirth %></p>
        <p><strong>Place of Birth:</strong> <%= placeOfBirth %></p>
      </div>

      <p>
        A new user has successfully completed their profile setup.  
        You can review or verify their details from the <strong>Admin Dashboard</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>🪔 The vedvivah Team</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.vaidikvivah.in">https://admin.vedvivah.com</a></p>
      <p>© 2025 VedVivah. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
